@startuml cpu_timing_pid_cycle
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title T-2: PID 制御 100ms サイクル × 1 秒 (10 サイクル)\n通常時 vs 構造的天井 #1 顕在化時の対比

robust "🎛️ control_thread (Phase 10 PID, 10Hz)" as CTRL
robust "🚚 usb_thread (TCP send)" as USB
robust "📷 camera_thread" as CAM
robust "📡 gs2200m driver" as GS

@0
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan
USB is "TCP send" #LightGreen
CAM is "DQBUF/pack" #LightGreen
GS is "SPI tx" #LightYellow

@10
CTRL is IDLE

@100
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan
USB is "TCP send" #LightGreen
CAM is "DQBUF/pack" #LightGreen
GS is "SPI tx" #LightYellow

@110
CTRL is IDLE

@200
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@210
CTRL is IDLE

@300
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@310
CTRL is IDLE

@400
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@410
CTRL is IDLE

' ==============================================================
' @500-700: 構造的天井 #1 顕在化 (TCP send が長期化)
' ==============================================================

@500
USB is "TCP send (劣化)" #Pink
GS is "SPI tx (block)" #Pink
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@510
CTRL is IDLE
note top of CTRL
  PID 計算は ~5ms (軽量)
  → 構造的天井 #1 でも本体は遅延しない
end note

@600
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan
USB is "TCP send (劣化)" #Pink
GS is "SPI tx (block)" #Pink
note bottom of USB
  Phase 9 ピーク時:
  TCP send が 1000ms+ でブロック
  構造的天井 #1 顕在化
end note

@610
CTRL is IDLE

@700
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan
USB is "TCP send (劣化)" #Pink
GS is "SPI tx (block)" #Pink

@710
CTRL is IDLE

' 復帰
@800
USB is "TCP send" #LightGreen
GS is "SPI tx" #LightYellow
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@810
CTRL is IDLE

@900
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@910
CTRL is IDLE

@1000
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan

@1010
CTRL is IDLE

' ==============================================================
highlight 500 to 700 #Pink : "構造的天井 #1 顕在化 (TCP 劣化)"

legend bottom
  **観察**:

  • **control_thread の優位性**: 優先度 100, PID 計算は < 5ms / 100ms 周期
    → 構造的天井 #1 が顕在化しても **PID サイクル自体は壊れない**

  • **しかし PID の "観測対象" が壊れる**:
    queue_depth が異常値になり、PID の出力が無効化される可能性
    → Phase 11 多変数制御で frame size + transmission time も入力に
       (現状 .c 未実装)

  • **Phase 11 .c 実装時の試算**:
    - 100ms 周期内で:
      * weighted_control_input: < 1ms
      * adaptive_pid_update: < 1ms
      * predictive_control_update (5-point trend): < 2ms
      * stability_check: < 1ms
    → 合計 < 5ms 増 (現 < 5ms から < 10ms へ)、十分余裕あり

  • **別の懸念 (frame_statistics)**:
    camera_thread が frame ごとに frame_statistics_update 呼出
    → camera_thread 側の負荷増 (本書では観測対象外)

  関連: Phase 10 commit 2ab7bfc / Phase 11 commit e371f94 (.c 未実装)
endlegend

@enduml
